SUMMARY:Wexford Mini Repair Café
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Mid-Scarborough Repair Hub – 2660 Eglinton Ave E\, Toronto\, ON 
 M1K 2S3\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:Hi! Join our Repair Café on November 28th from 10am to 1pm. Th
 e goal of repair cafes is to promote reuse and repair instead of wasting r
 esources. The event will be organized in Wexford at the Scarborough Citade
 l at 2021 Lawrence Ave. East and will invite neighbours to bring their clo
 thes\, small appliances and jewellery to be repaired. We are looking for v
 olunteers to help us sew and repair clothes as well as small appliances. I
 f you want to help\, contact us please! Registration ends at 12:30. Lookin
 g forward to seeing you there! The Scarborough Zero Waste Team!
GEO:43.7370792;-79.2504653
CATEGORIES:Midi Event
URL:https://repaircafetoronto.ca/rc-events/wexford-mini-repair-cafe-11/
END:VEVENT
