TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:CNIB Bayview
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:CNIB Bayview – 1929 Bayview Ave\, Toronto\, ON M4G 3E8\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:The Repair Café at the CNIB Bayview runs from 11 AM to 2 PM. T
 he primary focus of this event is on repairing accessibility devices such 
 as Perkins braillers\, white canes\, electronic magnifiers\, talking and 
 braille watches\, and sewing-related repairs. The Repair Café does not ch
 arge for repairs\, it is free! We encourage individuals to RSVP in advance
  to secure priority for repairs\, although walk-ins are also welcome. Whil
 e the event primarily serves the blind and visually impaired community\, w
 e may accommodate individuals outside of this community based on availabil
 ity and foot traffic. The Repair Café at the CNIB Bayview is usually held
  every two months on the third Saturday. For further details or inquiries\
 , please feel free to contact Dom at Dom.Chan@cnib.ca.
GEO:43.7172677;-79.3774668
CATEGORIES:Midi Event
URL:https://repaircafetoronto.ca/rc-events/cnib-gta-hub-6/
END:VEVENT
